  "reason": "The validation score has plateaued around 0.9502-0.9504 because training relies on a single 80/20 split with fixed heuristic blend weights and sub-optimal Nelder-Mead threshold tuning. A Tier 3 Systemic Paradigm Shift to 5-Fold Stratified Cross-Validation with Out-Of-Fold (OOF) probability stacking and a Multinomial Logistic Regression meta-learner will utilize 100% of training data while generating unbiased probability features. This calibrated stacking architecture directly optimizes the multi-class decision boundaries to maximize Balanced Accuracy.",
  "module": [
    "model_design",
