ogging format `Final Validation Score: {score}`."}, "parse_success": true, "raw_response": "{
  "reason": "Previous iterations plateaued because standard GBDT log-loss optimizes overall accuracy rather than balanced accuracy, causing decision boundaries and tree splits to favor majority health classes. To break this plateau, we execute a Tier 3 Systemic Paradigm Shift by introducing native categorical handling and direct class-balanced loss weighting in base models, coupled with a 2-stage Stacking Ensemble architecture with a class-weighted meta-learner.",
  "module": [
